<title>USA: Spartanburg Sewer District, S.C., yields 5.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Spartanburg Sewer District, S.C., yields 5.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond, James &amp; Associates said it tentatively priced $19.280 million of Spartanburg Sanitary Sewer District, S.C., sewer system improvement revenue bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.75 percent in 2027.</p>
</text>
